      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> drop/<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> seconds",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>th</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>st</mi></msup></math> drop will travel&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math> drop would have travelled</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Time for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math> drop</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Each drop have time gap of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> drop per second.</p>",
